# Environment
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Build output
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.test
*.out

# Go workspace
vendor/

# Built binary
#
# Both spellings, because only one of them was here and the other slipped past:
# `bin/sfu` was committed in the initial commit and stayed, 13 MB of compiled Go
# in every clone of the repository forever.
#
# Nothing consumes it. The Dockerfile runs `go build` itself, so the image never
# read the committed copy, and a developer runs the same command.
/sfu
/bin/
